' Observed behavior: getAgent returns binding identifiers and optional versions.
' Observed behavior: getRuntimeAgent returns ten-field Tool and nine-field
' bound Agent definitions without wrapper objects.
' Root and resolved response types include type and omit timestamps.
' Observed behavior: root and bound Agent prompts use the same composition.
' Integration pending: ToolDefinitionMapper SQL is supplied by the Tool owner.
' Design reason: batch dependency queries avoid one query per binding.
' Security hardening: a missing, disabled, or unmatched dependency fails closed.
' Product constraint: no partial Runtime Agent response is returned.
' Data-model constraint: t_agent_definition stores only the current Agent version.

actor "Runtime consumer" as Consumer
participant AgentDefinitionController as Controller
participant AgentDefinitionServiceImpl as Service
participant AgentToolBindingMapper as ToolBindingMapper
participant AgentBindingMapper as AgentBindingMapper
participant AgentDefinitionMapper as DefinitionMapper
participant ToolDefinitionMapper as ToolMapper
participant Logger

Consumer -> Controller: GET /mate-service/v1/agents/{agentId}/runtime
Controller -> Controller: validate agentId
Controller -> Service: getRuntimeAgent(agentId)
Service -> DefinitionMapper: selectById(agentId)
DefinitionMapper --> Service: root Agent definition

alt root Agent missing or disabled
  Service -> Logger: record root Agent context
  Service --> Controller: throw specific error code
else root Agent available
  par load direct bindings
    Service -> ToolBindingMapper: selectByAgentId(agentId)
    ToolBindingMapper --> Service: Tool bindings
  else
    Service -> AgentBindingMapper: selectByAgentId(agentId)
    AgentBindingMapper --> Service: Agent bindings
  end

  Service -> Service: create Tool id-version queries
  Service -> ToolMapper: selectByBindings(tool queries)
  ToolMapper --> Service: Tool fields with concurrency safety
  Service -> Service: create Agent id-version queries
  Service -> DefinitionMapper: selectByBindings(agent queries)
  DefinitionMapper --> Service: current matching Agent definitions

  alt dependency missing, disabled, or version unmatched
    Service -> Logger: record root id, dependency id, and version
    Service --> Controller: throw specific error code
  else every dependency resolved
    Service -> Service: compose root and bound Agent prompts
    Service -> Service: assemble flat Tools and Agents
    Service --> Controller: RuntimeAgentResponseVO
    Controller --> Consumer: success envelope
  end
end

note over Service,DefinitionMapper
  A null binding version selects the latest definition.
  A non-null version requires an exact id-version match.
  The current Agent table cannot return historical versions.
  Bound Agent definitions do not recursively expand bindings.
  Runtime prompts join nonblank fields with a blank line.
end note

note over Service,ToolMapper
  Tool SQL and Tool version storage are owned by the Tool module.
  The Agent module defines only the batch Mapper contract in this phase.
  Runtime Tools expose ten fields and omit schemas and timestamps.
  Missing concurrency safety defaults to false.
end note

@enduml
